flowchart TB
    accTitle: GitLab and execution components
    accDescr: The Runner polls GitLab and starts CI jobs. Jobs reach the controller over restricted SSH. The controller fetches Git and either runs directly or submits mesh work. Execution nodes initiate outbound mTLS and reach their own targets.
    G["GitLab CE<br/>Projects and pipelines"]
    R["Runner manager"]
    J["Deployment job"]
    C["Controller<br/>ctl-run"]
    S["Standalone targets"]
    I["Mesh ingress"]
    N["Execution node"]
    T["Mesh targets"]
    R -->|Poll jobs| G
    R -->|Start container| J
    J -->|Restricted SSH| C
    C -->|Fetch exact commit| G
    C -->|Ansible over SSH or WinRM| S
    C -->|Local socket| I
    N -->|Outbound mTLS| I
    I -->|Signed work on established connection| N
    N -->|Ansible over SSH or WinRM| T
